OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1793431591
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSALargest woodland bat survey a
OL,4,A'nice story of AI for good'
OL,5,
OL,6,FKate Jones, from University College
OL,7,FLondon, said: "AI has fundamentally
OL,8,Fchanged the scale at which we can
OL,9,Fmonitor wildlife." She added the survey
OL,10,Fwas a "nice story of AI for good".
